  // anon-function 3: start-seed-effect's own trans-hook handler, sets
  // draw death-timer to 200 through self (raw offset 192, +4 basic-tag
  // binding to process-drawable's own draw field). No :behavior clause
  // here left self/pp typed plain process, so (-> pp draw ...) fails to
  // compile even though the decompiler's own type_casts (register s6,
  // the same physical slot pp aliases) resolve the read cleanly during
  // decompilation without an ERROR banner: type_casts only informs the
  // decompiler's own internal resolution, not the printed self type this
  // anon-function's own declaration controls, so the printed text still
  // says plain pp. Matches jak3's identical landed closure
  // (goal_src/jak3/engine/gfx/foreground/merc/merc-death.gc:34), which
  // uses the same :behavior process-drawable form for the same field.
