    // og:preserve-this wvehicle-weapons-vein rung 2: anon-function 14's own
    // op 0 is `lb v1, 308(s6)` (a raw byte load) fed straight into a
    // truthy/`slt r0` guard. Rung 1 tried v-wpn-yellow-seismic-blaster and
    // vehicle-weapon-slot and neither cleared it (seismic-blaster ends at
