    // (all-types.gc) declares exactly that: run-targeting-this-frame, int8,
    // :offset-assert 312 -- placement matches the machine offset (308+4)
    // exactly, and the field's own byte width matches the raw `lb`. The
    // name matches the guard's own shape (a per-frame boolean gating
    // whatever follows). Retyped to this weapon's own gun/slot type.
